@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam defaultFontName PingFang TC
hide empty methods
hide circle
title 搶答題目顯示、手動出題與老師補答 · 類別圖
class "課堂活動" as Activity
class "搶答單位" as Unit {
  單題或題組
}
class "題目" as Question {
  完整題號
  題幹
  匯入或手動
}
class "標準答案" as AcceptedAnswer {
  一行一種寫法
  開題後固定，僅老師可見
}
class "原稿填空位置" as SourceCell
class "回合" as Round {
  準備、開放作答、待確認判分、已公布
}
class "組別" as Group
class "組別送答" as Submission {
  收件順位
}
class "作答項目" as Answer {
  答案原文
  自動判分
  老師更正後的最終正誤
}
class "老師補答" as TeacherAnswer {
  補答原文
}
class "已公布結果" as Result
Activity "1" *-- "0..*" Unit
Activity "1" *-- "0..*" Round
Activity "1" *-- "0..*" Group
Unit "1" *-- "1..*" Question
Question "1" *-- "0..*" AcceptedAnswer
Question "1" --> "0..1" SourceCell
Round "0..1" --> "1" Unit
Round "1" *-- "0..*" Submission
Submission "*" --> "1" Group
Submission "1" *-- "1..*" Answer
Answer "*" --> "1" Question
Round "1" *-- "0..*" TeacherAnswer
TeacherAnswer "*" --> "1" Question
Round "1" *-- "0..1" Result
Result "*" --> "0..1" Group : 勝組
note bottom of AcceptedAnswer
各完整題號在開題前須有至少一種答案。
end note
note bottom of TeacherAnswer
同回合每個無人答對的完整題號
各有一筆老師補答。
end note
@enduml
